OL,3,GNEWSAResidents to face fines for
OL,4,Aleaving bins out
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents leaving their bins out across
OL,7,FDerby could face a fine under new
OL,8,Fpowers being proposed by the council.
OL,10,FThree citywide Public Spaces Protection
OL,11,FOrders (PSPOs) - to address residential
OL,12,Fbins on streets, dog mess, and begging
OL,13,F- are set to be discussed at a meeting
OL,14,Fon Wednesday.
OL,16,FIf approved, powers would be given to
OL,17,Fthe council under the Anti-Social
OL,18,FBehaviour, Crime and Policing Act 2014
OL,19,Fto give warnings or issue fines.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
